1. e4 e5 2. Nf3 Nc6 3. Bc4 Bc5 4. b4 Bb6 5. a4 a6 6. c3 d6 7. d3 Nf6 8. O-O O-O
9. Bg5 h6 10. Bh4 Ne7 11. Bxf6 gxf6 12. Nh4 Kh7 13. Qh5 Ng6 14. Nf5 Bxf5 15.
Qxf5 Qe7 16. a5 Ba7 17. Nd2 Rg8 18. Kh1 Rg7 19. Rae1 Kh8 20. g3 Rag8 21. Nf3
Rh7 22. d4 Qd8 23. Rd1 Qe7 24. Ng1 h5 25. Nh3 h4 26. g4 Nf8 27. f4 exd4 28. e5
dxe5 29. Rde1 Qd6 30. Bd3 dxc3 31. fxe5 fxe5 32. Rxe5 Bd4 33. Re8 Qc6+ 34. Qe4
Rhg7 35. Qxc6 bxc6 36. Bxa6 Ne6 37. Rxg8+ Kxg8 38. g5 Nxg5 39. Nxg5 Rxg5 40.
Bd3 h3 41. Bc2 Kf8 42. Bb3 f6 43. Be6 Rg1+ 44. Rxg1 Bxg1 45. Bf5 Ba7 {Source:
Morning Post - Monday 07 July 1890} 0-1

